# Both instances are started by the Aspire AppHost.
@instance1 = https://localhost:5001
@instance2 = https://localhost:5002
@key = my-key

### 1. First read on instance 1: cache miss (~3 s), GeneratedBy = webapi1
GET {{instance1}}/data/{{key}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Read on instance 2: served from L2 (Garnet), GeneratedBy = webapi1
GET {{instance2}}/data/{{key}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Invalidate on instance 1: removed from L2, and from the L1 of instance 2 through the backplane
DELETE {{instance1}}/data/{{key}}

### 4. Read on instance 2: cache miss again, GeneratedBy = webapi2
GET {{instance2}}/data/{{key}}
Accept: application/json

### Soft invalidation: expired everywhere, but kept as a fail-safe fallback
POST {{instance1}}/data/{{key}}/expire
